\ A wrong twin (plan row TB1; tests/front/tactics/goal-layer-wrong.lean):
\ intros does not unfold ¬ a = b (by-intro would), so the goal stays as it
\ is and assumption fails with Lean's message (error 381) and the goal.
\ Lean: theorem w_is_not (a b : Nat) : ¬ a = b := by
\         intros
\         assumption
theorem w_is_not
  Nat explicit: a  Nat explicit: b
  a b = Not
:= by
  by-intros
  by-assumption
end w_is_not
